  "dst": "interior of the completed horizontally symmetric outline on the same canvas",
  "transform": "erase the visible outline; for each foreground row, mirror the row's rightmost foreground pixel across the half-column axis and fill the cells strictly between the boundary pair with the same color"
}
</annotation>
