    rows: 5-6 consecutive rows, no row gaps; UD symmetric
    per_row: one contiguous fg segment [outer_left..inner_left]
    inner_left_profile: starts/ends at axis_left (cap rows with fill_width=0), non-increasing first half then non-decreasing; step size 1-2
